are worn as a feasible means

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.880
of abatement in a control
plan designed to address

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:34.820
the hazards from SARS-CoV-2,

00:18:34.820 --> 00:18:36.830
the virus that causes COVID-19.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:39.370
Employers may choose to
use cloth face coverings

00:18:39.370 --> 00:18:41.020
as a means of source control,

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.180
such as because of transmission risk

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.160
that cannot be controlled
through engineering

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:47.860
or administrative controls,
including social distancing.

